            <abstract>
                <p>A prayer praising humility and kindness of <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS5684JesusCh">Jesus
                        Christ</persName> and asking for His protection. This prayer is not of a
                    magic nature itself, but might be used in protective scrolls, too, along with
                    <term key="Asmat" ana="#Asmat">Jesus’ sacred names</term>.</p>
            </abstract>
