                <note>The following incipit is taken from the manuscript <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/CBD936">Dublin, Chester Beatty Library Dublin, CBD W 936</ref>.</note>
                <ab>በስሙ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis"/> ንዜኑ፡ ዘአምላክነ፡ ኂሩት፡ ትኅትና፡ ወየውኀት፡ ዘእንበላ፡ ዓቅም፡ ዘሰቀሎ፡
                    ለሰማይ፡ ከመ፡ ቀመር፡ ጺበ፡ ዕፅ፡ <sic>ተስቅለ፡</sic> ዘከለሎ፡ ለሰማይ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis"/>
                </ab>
            </div>
            <div type="edition" xml:id="div2LIT7895NzenuLaAmlak">
